sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Borrower as Lecturer
    actor TO as Technical Officer
    participant API as FRMS Equipment API
    participant Store as Resource Catalogue
    participant Audit as Audit Log

    Borrower->>TO: Request equipment
    TO->>API: Issue equipment
    TO->>API: Record condition on issue
    API->>Store: Save allocation and update availability
    Store-->>API: Availability confirmed

    Borrower->>TO: Return equipment
    TO->>API: Record return and condition
    API->>Store: Close allocation and restore availability
    Store-->>API: Availability updated

    opt Equipment requires maintenance
        TO->>API: Log maintenance ticket
        API->>Store: Create maintenance blackout
        API->>Audit: Record blackout and reason
    end

    API-->>TO: Checkout lifecycle complete
